                        basis, linearly independent set, generators, finitely generated module
                    </p>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>
                Results to know
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <p>
                        Any finitely generated <m>R</m> module is isomoprhic to <m>R^n</m> for some <m>n</m>
                    </p>
